camstack/camstack-models is a collection. It has no single licence.

Each folder <category>/<model>/ is governed by the licence stated in its
README.md and in the table of the root README.md. The full texts are in
LICENSES/. Converting, quantising, fine-tuning or re-exporting a model does not
change its licence. Nothing in this repository is offered under terms broader
than its upstream's.

Folders whose weights are AGPL-3.0 (Ultralytics) are distributed under
AGPL-3.0; see LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt. Their Corresponding Source is set out in
THIRD_PARTY_MODELS.md, section "Source offer for the AGPL-3.0 weights".

Some folders are licensed for non-commercial or research use only; the root
README.md lists them under "Non-commercial models".

This file, README.md and the folder README.md cards are maintained in the
CamStack source repository (hf/camstack-models/). LICENSES/ is a copy of its
licenses/models/, and THIRD_PARTY_MODELS.md a copy of its root notice.
